Lets renderers share the glyphs they parse through a GlyphCache that the
caller gives each of them, so the maps of one runtime parse and keep each
glyph once instead of once per map and font stack. Temporary: drop this patch
when the submodule moves to a core that includes the pull request.
Upstream: https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native/pull/4855 at 9b98bbfb

